+- righttenantry-demo-mode (lavish gate, 2026-08-19): user verdict via in-browser queue buttons — CTA moment B (persistent in banner), CTA copy revised "Start your real vacancy" -> "Create your vacancy" (reads oddly for a visitor with no vacancy), analytics FFI APPROVED, fixtures 3+9 rich, entry hero+navbar; closing note "demo dash should match the actual dash" -> implementation reuses real view components (dashboard.gleam etc.), mock is only illustrative.
+- righttenantry-demo-mode (seam, 2026-08-19): demo dispatch at the MESSAGE level (client.gleam branches on model.demo_mode) keeps the real api modules byte-identical — zero regression on the live path; demo_api mirrors api signatures and dispatches the SAME response Msg constructors so update_inner's real handlers render the mock. Store is pure MVU model state (Gleam JS has no module mutability) — re-seeded on /demo entry + Reset.
+- righttenantry-demo-mode (lavish poll, 2026-08-19): 12-edit batch to the artifact hit TWO whole-batch silent rejects — one hunk had wrong indent depth (4 vs 6 spaces), one pair overlapped; verify each oldText's exact whitespace + disjointness via python count before re-firing.
+- righttenantry-demo-mode (Perkins r1, 2026-08-19): the demo's "no real network" pillar needs a STRUCTURAL guard, not prose — the fall-through class (real api calls in arms demo_update doesn't intercept) is real. scripts/lint_demo_network.py now enforces it (window + demo_update-intercepted manifest + demo-branched helpers). Keep the manifest in sync with demo_update.handle or the lint fails.
+- righttenantry-demo-mode (Perkins r1, 2026-08-19): three recurring demo-mode traps — (a) store mutations MUST be threaded back into the Model (let _ = next silently discards; every demo_api mutation returns #(store, eff)); (b) relative-URL fetches need rsvp.parse_relative_uri (gleam_http request.from_uri needs a host); (c) analysis-id vs app-id keying ("an-" vs "a-" prefixes) — pin with a unit test.
